{"id":"n49273-1-9","stage":3,"title":"탄생 · 诞生","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49273-1-9-1","ko":"드디어 우리 큰아들이 아이를 낳았답니다. 우리 집 첫 손주예요.","zh":"我们的大儿子终于有孩子了。这是我们家的第一个孙子/孙女呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"드디어","meaning":"终于，到底，总算","explanation":"드디어：终于，到底，总算","readings":[{"term":"드디어","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15026","senseId":"1","lemma":"드디어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"큰아들이","meaning":"大儿子","explanation":"큰아들：大儿子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"큰아들","audio":"/audio/689df3659246e585197a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28174","senseId":"1","lemma":"큰아들","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아이를","meaning":"孩子","explanation":"아이：孩子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"2","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"낳았답니다.","meaning":"生","explanation":"낳다：生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；답니다：礼貌地告知自己知道或听说的事实。","readings":[{"term":"낳다","audio":"/audio/2f8905ecc8e062b159a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64391","senseId":"1","lemma":"낳다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"첫","meaning":"首次，初次，第一次","explanation":"첫：首次，初次，第一次","readings":[{"term":"첫","audio":"/audio/9195c91a6f506a7d56aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77610","senseId":"1","lemma":"첫","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손주예요.","meaning":"孙子","explanation":"손주：孙子；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"손주","audio":"/audio/bc65d15e5bc9ac97ce01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92531","senseId":"1","lemma":"손주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dfc77ad537b73519","term":"드디어","zh":"终于，到底，总算","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3","entryId":"15026","definition":"期待已久的最终；到了最后。","pronunciation":["드디어"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"689df3659246e585","term":"큰아들","zh":"大儿子","audio":"/audio/689df3659246e585197a.mp3","entryId":"28174","definition":"在两个或两个以上的儿子中，排行最大的儿子。","pronunciation":["크나들"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"(谦词)自己的子女。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"2f8905ecc8e062b1","term":"낳다","zh":"生","audio":"/audio/2f8905ecc8e062b159a5.mp3","entryId":"64391","definition":"把肚子里的孩子、崽子、卵送出体外。","pronunciation":["나ː타"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"9195c91a6f506a7d","term":"첫","zh":"首次，初次，第一次","audio":"/audio/9195c91a6f506a7d56aa.mp3","entryId":"77610","definition":"最初的。","pronunciation":["첟"]},{"id":"bc65d15e5bc9ac97","term":"손주","zh":"孙子","audio":"/audio/bc65d15e5bc9ac97ce01.mp3","entryId":"92531","definition":"孙子和孙女。","pronunciation":["손주"]}],"audio":"/audio/408720e41291b1aa7c87.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49273-1-9-2","ko":"기쁘시겠어요. 손주 탄생을 축하드립니다.","zh":"您一定很高兴吧？恭喜您迎来了孙辈。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기쁘시겠어요.","meaning":"高兴，开心","explanation":"기쁘다：高兴，开心；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"기쁘다","audio":"/audio/34ce48b9a78ae52e1c3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40078","senseId":"1","lemma":"기쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손주","meaning":"孙子","explanation":"손주：孙子","readings":[{"term":"손주","audio":"/audio/bc65d15e5bc9ac97ce01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92531","senseId":"1","lemma":"손주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"탄생을","meaning":"诞生","explanation":"탄생：诞生；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"탄생","audio":"/audio/d65f09b0b7d79712dd4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49273","senseId":"1","lemma":"탄생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"축하드립니다.","meaning":"祝贺，庆贺，道贺；(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","explanation":"축하：祝贺，庆贺，道贺；드리다：(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"축하","audio":"/audio/02fbd137536a81840667.mp3"},{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72137","senseId":"1","lemma":"축하","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"34ce48b9a78ae52e","term":"기쁘다","zh":"高兴，开心","audio":"/audio/34ce48b9a78ae52e1c3f.mp3","entryId":"40078","definition":"心情非常好，十分愉快。","pronunciation":["기쁘다"]},{"id":"bc65d15e5bc9ac97","term":"손주","zh":"孙子","audio":"/audio/bc65d15e5bc9ac97ce01.mp3","entryId":"92531","definition":"孙子和孙女。","pronunciation":["손주"]},{"id":"d65f09b0b7d79712","term":"탄생","zh":"诞生","audio":"/audio/d65f09b0b7d79712dd4f.mp3","entryId":"49273","definition":"人出生。","pronunciation":["탄ː생"]},{"id":"02fbd137536a8184","term":"축하","zh":"祝贺，庆贺，道贺","audio":"/audio/02fbd137536a81840667.mp3","entryId":"72137","definition":"对于别人发生的好事开心地表示问候；或指那样的问候。","pronunciation":["추카"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"59252","definition":"(尊称)表示前面的言语或行动给他人的行动带来影响。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/eaa7ca6717f386014bbe.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.07,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=49273","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":112,"sequenceScore":2.8967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["您一定很高兴吧？恭喜您迎来了孙辈。","最近我经常和老公吵架，真让人烦心。","我们的大儿子终于有孩子了。这是我们家的第一个孙子/孙女呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您一定很高兴吧？恭喜您迎来了孙辈。","我们的大儿子终于有孩子了。这是我们家的第一个孙子/孙女呢。","最近我经常和老公吵架，真让人烦心。"],"answer":0}]}
